@WebApplicationforCICD_HostAddress = http://localhost:5025
### Get all products
GET {{WebApplicationforCICD_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
### Get product by ID
GET {{WebApplicationforCICD_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
### Create a product
POST {{WebApplicationforCICD_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 79.99
}